-- Adds EUROSTAT as a DataSource. Hand-written rather than generated by
-- `prisma migrate dev`, because that tool's shadow-database validation step
-- fails on this project's migration history: an earlier migration
-- (20260704120000_auth_user_trigger_and_cascade) creates a trigger on
-- Supabase's auth.users table, and the ephemeral shadow database `migrate
-- dev` spins up has no `auth` schema to replay that migration against. That
-- is a pre-existing incompatibility between Supabase-managed schemas and
-- Prisma's shadow-DB workflow, unrelated to this change. `migrate deploy`
-- applies migration files directly against the target database without a
-- shadow database, so it is unaffected and is the correct tool going
-- forward for any migration on this project until that history issue is
-- resolved separately.
ALTER TYPE "DataSource" ADD VALUE 'EUROSTAT';
